```mermaid
graph TD
    %% Define styles
    classDef client fill:#d4edda,stroke:#28a745,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef platform fill:#cce5ff,stroke:#007bff,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef datastore fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#ffc107,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef external fill:#f8d7da,stroke:#dc3545,stroke-width:2px;

    %% Client Layer
    Clients["Enterprise Client Apps<br/>(Chatbots, Agents, Copilots)"]:::client

    %% Gateway
    API["API Gateway<br/>(REST Interface)"]:::platform

    %% Core Components
    subgraph Enterprise Context Engineering Platform
        Assembler["Context Assembler<br/>(Orchestrator)"]:::platform
        Memory["Memory Manager"]:::platform
        Budget["Token Budget Optimizer"]:::platform
        Compressor["Context Compressor"]:::platform
        Template["Prompt Template Engine"]:::platform
        Retrieval["Retrieval Integrator"]:::platform
    end

    %% Data Stores
    Cache[("ElastiCache Redis<br/>(Context Cache)")]:::datastore
    DB[("DynamoDB<br/>(Conversation Memory)")]:::datastore

    %% External
    LLM["LLM Providers<br/>(OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini)"]:::external
    RAG["Enterprise RAG Systems<br/>(Vector DBs)"]:::external

    %% Connections
    Clients -->|POST /assemble| API
    Clients -->|RAG Documents| RAG
    
    API --> Assembler
    
    Assembler <-->|Check/Set| Cache
    Assembler <-->|Fetch/Save History| Memory
    Assembler <-->|Calculate Limits| Budget
    Assembler <-->|Extractive Summarization| Compressor
    Assembler <-->|Inject Variables| Template
    Assembler <-->|Merge Context| Retrieval
    
    Memory <-->|Persist/Retrieve| DB
    Retrieval <-->|Query Documents| RAG
    
    Assembler -->|Optimized Payload| LLM
```
